# Project
# .governor runtime state stays ignored, but the orchestration-loop program
# counter + its custody trail live in git (loop-protocol: "the program counter
# is in git"). Negations require the parent not be fully excluded, hence /*.
.governor/*
!.governor/loop.json
!.governor/loop-receipts/
!.governor/backlog/
baselines/
*.tar.gz

